=== SURVEY ===
  Web source of truth — web/src/components/ui/Drawer.tsx:
    A portal-rendered, purely-presentational slide-in side panel. Props:
      open, onClose, title?, children, footer?, side ('left'|'right', default 'right'),
      className?.
    Behaviour: role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label={title || 'Panel'}; a fading
      backdrop scrim (bg var(--surface-overlay) + blur) that closes on click (aria-hidden);
      a panel that springs in from the side (x 100%->0 right / -100%->0 left, spring
      damping 30 stiffness 300); a titled header (rendered only when `title`) with an <h3>
      + a close <button aria-label="Close"><X/></button>; a scrollable flex-1 body
      (children); an optional footer over an overlay surface; a focus trap (focus first
      focusable, Tab/Shift-Tab cycle), Escape-to-close, and focus restore on unmount.
    Literal strings: only the `aria-label={title || 'Panel'}` fallback + close
      `aria-label="Close"`. No data hooks; no loading/empty/error/stale/offline of its own
      (those belong to whatever `children` it hosts). The prompt records "Data sources:
      (none — pure presentational component)".
